# The two database roles' passwords (ADR-041, ADR-145), with no values: .env is ignored by git, so
# never commit them. postgres/initdb/create-roles.sql reads both when it creates the roles in an empty
# database, and stops when either is empty or both are the same; make each one with, for example,
# `openssl rand -base64 32`. A start that stopped there leaves the data folder without the roles, so
# remove its volume before starting again. The migrate step connects with the owner's and the core
# with app's, each through its own SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD; the core never gets the owner's.
DISPATCHFLOW_OWNER_PASSWORD=
DISPATCHFLOW_APP_PASSWORD=
